    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h1 data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3042\">\ud83d\udcda Cross-Reference Reality</h1><p data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3056\"><em data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3056\">(6th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +1</p><p data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3089\"><em data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3089\">\u201cThis pattern is documented.\u201d</em></p><p data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3157\">You may link two or more active Precedents as supporting evidence.</p><p data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3197\">By spending <strong data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3187\">Surge</strong>, you may:</p><ul data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3380\"><li data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3256\"><p data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3256\">Extend a Precedent\u2019s influence to an analogous target</p></li><li data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3324\"><p data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3324\">Impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on actions that contradict multiple records</p></li><li data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3380\"><p data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3380\">Propagate a recorded aspect into a similar scenario</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3441\">The more aligned the pattern, the stronger the enforcement.</p><h3 data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3451\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3477\">Spend 1 Surge.</p><h3 data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3491\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3637\">Aggressive cross-referencing increases <strong data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3558\">Noise</strong>, especially when used to override player agency or freeze evolving situations.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
